   "speechEnd": 4.519
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-01",
   "text": "2025 年 2 月，Bybit 的冷钱包多签被盗，损失约 15 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 2 月，Bybit 的冷钱包多签被盗，损失约 15 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.588,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 5.686,
   "speechEnd": 10.781
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-02",
   "text": "FBI 公告把它归因于朝鲜。",
   "spoken": "FBI 公告把它归因于朝鲜。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.832,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 11.93,
   "speechEnd": 14.108
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-03",
   "text": "Safe 的初步报告称，2 月 4 日，一名开发者的电脑失陷。",
   "spoken": "Safe 的初步报告称，2 月 4 日，一名开发者的电脑失陷。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.172,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 15.27,
   "speechEnd": 19.305
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-04",
   "text": "起因是运行了一个受污染的 Docker 项目。",
   "spoken": "起因是运行了一个受污染的 Docker 项目。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.36,
   "dur": 3.624,
   "speechStart": 20.458,
   "speechEnd": 23.136
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-05",
   "text": "攻击者没能注册自己的验证设备，就劫持了活跃的 AWS 会话令牌。",
   "spoken": "攻击者没能注册自己的验证设备，就劫持了活跃的 AWS 会话令牌。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-05.mp3",
   "start": 24.204,
   "dur": 6.336,
   "speechStart": 24.302,
   "speechEnd": 29.706
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-06",
   "text": "然后，篡改了 S3 上 Safe 网页前端的脚本。",
   "spoken": "然后，篡改了 S3 上 Safe 网页前端的脚本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.76,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 30.858,
   "speechEnd": 34.239
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-07",
   "text": "脚本先判断，发起交易的是不是 Bybit 的多签地址。",
   "spoken": "脚本先判断，发起交易的是不是 Bybit 的多签地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-07.mp3",
   "start": 35.3,
   "dur": 4.608,
   "speechStart": 35.398,
   "speechEnd": 39.064
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-08",
   "text": "不是，就一切正常。",
   "spoken": "不是，就一切正常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-08.mp3",
   "start": 40.128,
   "dur": 2.568,
   "speechStart": 40.226,
   "speechEnd": 41.868
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-09",
   "text": "是，界面照样显示一笔正常转账，实际构造的是一次 DELEGATECALL。",
   "spoken": "是，界面照样显示一笔正常转账，实际构造的是一次 DELEGATECALL。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-09.mp3",
   "start": 42.916,
   "dur": 6.864,
   "speechStart": 43.014,
   "speechEnd": 48.93
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-10",
   "text": "签名人在硬件钱包上签名，只看到一串哈希。",
   "spoken": "签名人在硬件钱包上签名，只看到一串哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-10.mp3",
   "start": 50.0,
   "dur": 4.584,
   "speechStart": 50.098,
   "speechEnd": 53.74
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-11",
   "text": "签名凑够门槛，交易执行，多签的实现合约被替换。",
   "spoken": "签名凑够门槛，交易执行，多签的实现合约被替换。",
