   "spoken": "外部研究者打开页面，看到的一切正常。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-13.mp3",
   "start": 66.788,
   "dur": 4.104,
   "speechStart": 66.886,
   "speechEnd": 70.04
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-14",
   "text": "Verichains 称，恶意代码只在特定条件下激活。",
   "spoken": "Verichains 称，恶意代码只在特定条件下激活。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep20/audio/lines/seg5-14.mp3",
   "start": 71.112,
   "dur": 4.44,
   "speechStart": 71.21,
   "speechEnd": 74.721
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5-15",
   "text": "Sygnia 认为，Safe 的云存储账号或密钥很可能泄露。",
   "spoken": "Sygnia 认为，Safe 的云存储账号或密钥很可能泄漏。",
